= Manfred Ackermann

Aufhäuser is a prominent member of the GPA, the federation of socialist white-collar trade unions, and the youth wing of the party.

- @white_collar
- @union_unity
- @crisis
- @youth_wing
- @radicalize_middle
- @root: Return to main

@white_collar
title: Organizing white-collar workers
subtitle: Improve our standing among the new middle class.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; new_middle_sdapo += 6*(1-dissent); socialism += 3*(1-dissent)

We have increased our organizing among white-collar workers.

@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 10;

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction.

@crisis
title: Addressing the economic crisis
subtitle: Ackermann can help support a left-wing economic program.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and nationalization_adopted == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1 and nationalization_support <= 3
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if nationalization_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the Left plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; 
go-to: crisis_program.support_left 

@youth_wing
title: Support the youth organisations
subtitle: Ackermann can expand our youth organisations
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if resources < 1 : do not have the necessary resources ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources -= 1; sb_strength += 50; sb_militancy += 0.02; young_socialists += 1; left_strength += 5; reformist_strength += 5; radicalization += 1;

@radicalize_middle
title: Radicalize the new middle class.
subtitle: Awaken the class consciousness of the white collar worker.
choose-if: socialism >= 54 and new_middle_spd_normalized >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: They are not yet radical enough.
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: new_middle_consciousness
